WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.084
Step 1. Open the schedule.

1.2
00:00:02.084 --> 00:00:06.670
Remove an exception when you are available again for that period.

1.3
00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:11.755
Open the account menu, select Profile, then the Availability tab.

2.1
00:00:11.755 --> 00:00:15.779
Step 2. Find the exception. Select the Exceptions tab.

2.2
00:00:15.779 --> 00:00:20.600
It lists the exceptions that overlap the month shown on the calendar,

2.3
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.637
here Training session.

3.1
00:00:22.637 --> 00:00:24.872
Step 3. Start the removal.

3.2
00:00:24.872 --> 00:00:31.403
On the exception that you want to remove, here Training session, select Remove.

4.1
00:00:31.403 --> 00:00:35.793
Step 4. Confirm the removal. Care asks Are You Sure?

4.2
00:00:35.793 --> 00:00:39.933
and warns that this cannot be undone. Select Delete.

4.3
00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:44.811
Care shows Exception deleted and removes the exception.
